window.products.push({"id":1008076,"name":"NC Adhesive Hooks 10 Pack, Premium Transparent Stainless Steele Towel Kitchenware Hooks 15lb(Max), Waterproof Oilproof, Bathroom Kitchen Wall Utility ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JB5E-s+fL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. 【About us】 We have been committed to creating daily necessities and kitchen supplies with the concept of \"practicality first\", focusing on product design and manufacturing, and letting our products bring practicality to every customer who uses them. Our powerful adhesive hooks can satisfy you For outdoor, bathroom, kitchen, bedroom, garage, living room or other space needs, it can be used as coat hook, coat hook, key hook, light hook, knife hook, Christmas light hook, other holiday hooks, or birthday It can be used at parties, weddings, gatherings of friends and other occasions to bring fun and convenience to your life. 2. 【How to install】 ①. Before installation: Use a clean towel or dry cloth to wipe the location to be installed to ensure that the surface of the installation location is clean, dry, free of dust and oil. ②. Remove the transparent protective film on the back of the hook. ③. Paste it on the place where it needs to be installed, and fully press the hook to remove the air bubbles inside. ④. It is recommended to hang objects 24 hours after installation to ensure that the hooks are firmly fixed. 3. 【Product Information】 ①. Material: PVC material + high quality stainless steel. ②. Packing information: 10 strong sticking hooks per pack. ③. Hook size: 2.36 * 2.36 inches. ④. Packing size: 8 * 5.6 * 2 inches. ⑤. Weight capacity: 15 lb. 4. 【Warm Reminder】 ①. Do not use in high temperature (greater than 80 degrees Celsius) and humid environment. ②. Do not hang overweight, fragile and expensive items. ③. Please do not use it on wallpaper walls, painted walls, rotten walls, or too rough walls, because our hooks are strong hooks. Once attached, these walls may be damaged or fall off. ④. If it is used on wallpaper or painted walls, please do not tear off easily, as tearing off may damage the wall.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JB5E-s+fL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\C","source_asin":"B09NBMHH1J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008076","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NBMHH1J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NBMHH1J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
