window.products.push({"id":1008122,"name":"Creative Scents 4 Piece Bathroom Accessory Set - Bathroom Decor Set Accessories Includes: Liquid Soap Dispenser, Bar Soap Dish, Toothbrush Holder and ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b5cHtjoLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Is your bathroom in disarray? Looking to declutter and decorate? This four piece bathroom accessory set by Creative Scents is your solution. Each set neatly holds your basic bathroom accessories while adding an elegant touch. Our pump dispenser holds liquid soap, while our dish holds bar soap. Our toothbrush holder contains both your toothbrush and tooth paste with a hole at the bottom to drain excess water. Easily rinse your mouth with our handy tumbler cup. PRODUCT FEATURES: 4 Piece Set: - Liquid Soap Dispenser- Soap Dish- Toothbrush Holder- Rinsing Cup DETAILED DESIGN Here at Creative Scents, we carefully craft each individual piece. Our soap dish is generously sized to hold any bar, while our toothbrush holder can contain both your manual or electric toothbrush and your toothpaste. The latter also has a hole at the bottom to drain water droplets. Our liquid soap dispenser features a sturdy pump that does not clog or break as lower-quality competitor’s do. Our tumblers are compact sized for convenience. Just as our bathroom accessory sets are functional, so too they are fashionable. Select our best-looking theme, \"Mirror Damask \". It features neutral colors and seamless designs that will complement any bathroom decor. In our Mirror Damask design, feast your eyes on a white damask pattern with a light gray background and square-shaped reflective mirror appliques. The soap dispenser, dish, and toothbrush holder are oval-shaped, while the cup is round.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71b5cHtjoLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Scents","source_asin":"B06X9KXG6S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06X9KXG6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06X9KXG6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
