window.products.push({"id":1008241,"name":"Alphlower Potted 4.1ft Artificial Olive Tree with Bendable, Adjustable Branches - Decorative Fake Greenery Trees in Pots for Home, Restaurant & Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NZ5PyqBqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Alphlower Fake Olive Trees – Realistic Artificial Potted Plants & Trees for Home or Office Decor The quality of your artificial greenery makes a drastic difference when it comes to how realistic it looks.  To make the selection process easier for you, we have designed the perfect artificial accent tree for decor! Bendable Fake Leaves Can Be Positioned & Adjusted to Suit the Space You Are Decorating The neat thing about this here 4.1 foot artificial olive tree is that it features adjustable branches that can be  positioned in various ways. All you have to do is gently adjust the metal wire to get the look you're after. Fluff them out for a fuller, more voluminous look or use them to produce a more slender silhouette. Made out of Plastic Super Easy to Clean; Simply Wipe with a Cloth or Duster Brush/Tool Since it's made entirely out of top grade plastics, our artificial potted tree is easy to clean. If the leaves, the stems or the base happen to get a bit dusty, wipe them down with a damp cloth or use a duster to get  them back to their pristine evergreen state. Our fake plants require little to NO upkeep or watering. 4.1 ft Tree Height Ideal Size for Displaying in Home, Office & Restaurant Settings Big & Small With a height of 125cm, our fake plant décor looks marvelous when displayed in either large or small  spaces. Already in pots, you can set the fake trees in your grand entryway, foyer, office waiting room,  reception room or hotel lobby. It's big, beautiful & waiting to bring a touch of sophistication to your décor. Ready to decorate? Decorating green spaces no longer requires a green thumb or a landscaping team.  You know what to do. Click ' ADD TO CART ' to order your own 4.1 foot artificial olive tree in pot today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NZ5PyqBqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"alphlower","source_asin":"B09YLDX3Q1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008241","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YLDX3Q1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YLDX3Q1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
