window.products.push({"id":1008291,"name":"DTDNFE Kitchen Chef Knife Set, 3 Piece Sharp Chefs Knives Japanese 7Cr17mov High Carbon Stainless Steel, Ultra Sharp Cooking Knife for Vegetable Meat ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618zvWE9GsS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"[POWERFUL CHEF'S KNIFE SET] - The 3 PCS kitchen chefs knife boxed set includes 8\" Chef Knife,7\" Cleaver Knife and 3.5\" Paring Knife.Whether you need to cut meat or vegetables, or even if you need to peel fruits, they can meet your needs. The sharp knife allows you to enjoy the entire cooking process and save time. They are a necessity in the kitchen. [SUPERB FORGING TECHNOLOGY] - The kitchen chef's knives set using high carbon forged stainless steel material, hardness HRC 56-58 degrees,sharp, elastic.Blade use eight processes of repeated grinding, laser technology inspection, sharp blade wear.The chefs knife back use 45 degrees polished, smooth as mirror, make your thumb more comfortable. [UNIQUE ANTI-RUST DESIGN] - This Japanese chef's knife set has a unique anti-rust design. After eight processes of repeated grinding, a laser is used to engrave beautiful patterns on its surface. Finally, it undergoes a special \"passivation treatment\",a protective film is formed on the surface of the knife to prevent it from chemically reacting with oxygen. The anti-rust effect is increased by 50 times. Effectively improve its service life. [Use AND PRECAUTIONS]-Do not wash with water! The laser pattern makes the surface of the knife have fine grooves. If not handled properly, the residual moisture in the groove will oxidize with the Viking knife and cause it to rust. So the best maintenance method is: after use, quickly wipe it dry with a dry towel (be careful not to cut your fingers), and then apply a layer of cooking oil or animal oil on the surface of the knife. Well, it will never rust! [PERFECT GIFT AND GUARANTEE] - Every kitchen knife has an excellent quality guarantee, so you can buy with confidence. This chef's knife is packed in a box and is a great gift for family and friends. If you are not satisfied after receiving the goods, I am willing to replace it for free or give a full refund. When you contact us, we will reply within 24 hours and provide perfect service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618zvWE9GsS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DTDNFE","source_asin":"B0963Y1NJP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0963Y1NJP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0963Y1NJP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
