window.products.push({"id":1008366,"name":"Fine Mesh Sieve Nut Milk Bag - 128 OZ Capacity! Nylon Cheesecloth, Chinois, Tofu Press Alternative- Crafts Soymik, Almond, Cashew Milk - Kefir, Cheese","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fjPzG9zVL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Smart Nut Revolution Nut Milk Bag is the first of its kind. This bag has NO SEAMS where it matters most: the bottom of the bag! This is where all the pressure of squeezing occurs, and every other generic bag on the market suffers from this fundamental flaw. But we didn't just stop at redesigning the shape. Fed up with the thin, flimsy mesh of other bags, we found the THICKEST, HIGHEST QUALITY MESH used in commercial grade filtration systems. What we created is a bag strong enough to hold a bowling ball, large enough to hold a gallon of liquid, and durable enough to last thousands of cycles. In fact, this bag is so strong you can use the \"tourniquet method\" of milking and juicing. Once you've poured your pulp into the bag, draw the opening tight, and rotate the bottom of the bag until it forms a compact ball. With each turn, you'll apply more pressure and extract more liquid from your pulp. Try this with any other bag, and stitches pop like the 4th of July. We also added a drawstring stopper to add a unique function to this kitchen multi-tool. Since our bag can open to a completely flat circle, you can cover pots, pans, and dishes as large as 19\" in diameter and cinch the drawstring tight around its edges. Create a sieve over any bowl. Protect your picnic from critters. The potential uses are endless. If you like to squeeze every last drop of goodness out of your pulp, this bag is for you. Concoct smooth Almond, Soy and Cashew Milk. Strain the finest kefir. Cold-brew the perfect coffee. Want to get the water out of your tofu? Our bag doubles as a tofu press. Filter delicious kombucha tea. Make sprouts. Guaranteed to be the strongest, most versatile filter bag on the market, or your money back! We’re so confident in our products, WE OFFER A LIFETIME GUARANTEE. Use and abuse this bag—if you break it, we’ll give you a new one or a 100% refund. We love our bag, and we know you’ll love it too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fjPzG9zVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Smart Nut Company","source_asin":"B01GN7WX2G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GN7WX2G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01GN7WX2G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
