window.products.push({"id":1008455,"name":"LiKee Marble Alarm Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pd-dWqBFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Did you miss the last bus?, an important meeting?, or a date with girlfriends? Have you been late for class at school?, for work?, for a party? or for anything interesting? …… From now on, this LiKee alarm clock can make you being a Punctual Person! 3 Display Modes (dp-1, dp-2, dp-3) Available, Suitable for Any Situation dP-1: Automatically switches between time (10s), date (2s) and temperature (2s) in turns; dP-2: Fixed display of alarm, date or temperature you choose what to see all the time; dP-3: After showing either the alarm, the date or the temperature for 10 seconds, the screen will return to display the time. 3 Alarms (-R1, -R2, -R3) Are Yours to Set, So You Always Arrive On Time LiKee alarm clock offers you 3 alarms to set, which means you can set different alarms for different times based on your needs. It is time to say goodbye to being late. Other Function: Power Save: When setting from “--:Sd” to “oN:Sd”, this screen will turn off after 10 seconds. Voice Control: Under power save, you can wake up this clock by touching it or by clapping your hands (any noise louder than 60dbm). Memory function: This clock will automatically update the time after a power outage. Dual Power Supply: 3 AAA dry batteries (not included) or use the included USB Cable Specifications: Material: Medium-density fiberboard LED Color: White Sound sensor: available for switching on/off Thermometer Display: either ℃/℉ Time Mode: either 12H / 24H Product weights: 200g Product size: 4.9 x 2.6 x 1.8 inch (L*W*H) Power source: Powered by USB cable or 4 x AAA batteries (NOT included).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pd-dWqBFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LiKee","source_asin":"B071LMTNQQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008455","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071LMTNQQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071LMTNQQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
