window.products.push({"id":1008629,"name":"binz Built for Life Stainless Steel Water Bottle (18oz 27oz 40oz) Vacuum Insulated Double Wall Canteen with 2 BPA Free Lids (Straw, Simple Spout, Coff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lV2Mzy+5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your Bottle - Are you looking for a bottle that can keep your drinks hot or cold for hours at a time? binz bottles are perfect whether you're relaxing on the beach, roasting marshmallows at a campfire, heading to the gym, hiking a mountain, or planning life's next adventure! The premium double wall, vacuum insulation technology maintains the temperature of your beverages, so they stay cold for 30 hours and hot for 12. As a bonus your bottle is never hot to the touch and there's never any condensation. Good For the Earth & Your Health Our eco friendly bottles are made from premium, food grade, 18/8 stainless steel (known for strength and durability). We have your health in mind, as our bottles are safe, BPA-free, and toxin-free. They are rust resistant and don't retain or transfer flavors. No matter how many times you fill it, your insulated binz will keep today's drink fresh. Easy to Grip and Durable The outer powder coating gives you a slip-free grip and extra durability so you won't have to worry about dropping your beverage when you're out and about! Your binz can go anywhere life takes you and will last as long as the journey. It's the perfect travel companion. Smart Design with Leak-Proof BPA-Free Lids We've designed our premium bottles to be easy to use and accommodating for ice cubes and bottle brushes. The slim design of the 18 oz and 27 oz bottles fits perfectly in cup holders and bike cages. The straw lid gives you easy access to your drink on the go. The flip-top lid is versatile and perfect for sipping your favorite coffee or tea. The twist-top spout lid is great for pouring or chugging your beverage of choice. All lids are leak-proof and BPA-free and all but the flip lid have comfortable, convenient grab-and-go handles so they're easily portable. Lifetime Warranty If you're not satisfied, contact us for a replacement or full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lV2Mzy+5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"binz","source_asin":"B07HDCDGB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HDCDGB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HDCDGB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
