window.products.push({"id":1008669,"name":"Edomi Buckwheat Pillow Neck Roll Pillow Cervical Lumbar Support Pillow Round Therapeutic Bolster Pillow for Stomach Sleepers Spine and Back Pain Buckw","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wkoNDXJUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT MATERIALS & HOW CARE: 100% skin-friendly breathable fabric + High-quality buckwheat hulls filled. Handmade, ergonomic design. Buckwheat hulls are hard, which helps air circulate under the neck and promotes more cool sleep. Can relieve your sleeping problems, make you enjoy the wonderful night. Do not wash hulls. Pillow cases can be washed and then air dried. HOW TO USE: Our neck roll pillows have an hidden zipper in the buckwheat pillow insert, it allows you to adjust the height and the firmness of the cervical pillow. You might need to add or remove some hulls to find your ideal feel, the more hulls you remove the softer and more shapeable. WHO NEED IT: Our round cervical pillow is designed with the utmost comfort, durability, and versatility in mind for all-night support. Perfect for back, stomach and side sleepers. 【16x4 Inch】Whether your napping at home or in office ourbolster-shaped pillow supports your neck and head in a position, make you more comfortable, more relax. WHERE TO PAIN RELIEF: The cylinder pillow great for reducing pain sleep problems to provide neck and shoulder pain, muscle pain, stiff neck, headache, stress and tension at night. Very suitable for neck roll pillow, knee pillow, leg pillow, lumbar pillow, foot pillow. Between ankles, between legs, under knees, lower back and head, neck support. EDOMI Provide 100 Nights Free Trial for Pillows, RETURNS are FREE and EASY. if you unhappy, REACH US ! (PS: We believe you should sleep on your pillow to decide if you like it, and it can take the body least 30 nights to adjust to a new pillow.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wkoNDXJUS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Edomi","source_asin":"B0C2Q4MP6N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008669","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2Q4MP6N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2Q4MP6N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
