window.products.push({"id":1008897,"name":"Recaceik 3 Piece Pub Table Set, Rectangular Bar Table with 2 Bar Stools, Faux Marble Dining Room Table Set of 2, Modern Counter Height Table with Stor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wPog-4LCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Modern & Simple Bar Table-3 pieces pub table set: The exquisite and elegant rustic MDF table top and the simple and sturdy metal frame make this bar table set suitable for many occasions and various home decoration styles.The spacious table top and soft chairs allow two people to enjoy food and wine comfortably. This 3 piece bar table set is suitable for bars, restaurants, and coffee shops. If you take this bar table and chair home, whether it is in the living room, kitchen, dining room, breakfast corner, it is very practical. Space-saving Design-3 piece pub table set:This counter height dining bar set includes 1 bar table and 2 bar stools. The dining bar table unlike most other dining bar sets on the market, with its open design and compact size, two bar stools can be easily tucked under the bar table other side. On the side of the table, 2 tier storage shelves provides you with sufficient space for storage and decoration and providing excellent space solutions for bars, kitchens or apartments with limited space. Super sturdy and stable structure-3-piece pub table set: This 47-inch rectangle bar table set is made of faux marble and a sturdy metal frame to ensure stability and durability, which is durable and has a long service life. The legs are very stable on the floor and there is no wobble problem at all. The bar stool has a load-bearing capacity of up to 220 pounds. The table top can hold up to 110 pounds. Bar Lovers optimal choice -3 piece pub table set: Whether you like a drink with friends or a light breakfast before you're on the go, this bar table and chairs set is sure to delight. Elegant rustic brown MDF tabletop and composed black tones, creates a it rounds off your leisure or busy times with a cozy, pub-like vibe, decorate your party to make it more exciting and memorable. What You Get-3 piece pub table set: A bar table, 2 bar stools, assembly accessories. (Bar table size 47.24\"\"L x 23.62\"\"W x 33.07\"\"H . Bar stool size: 15.7''L x 11.8'' D x 23.81''H. Pedal height: 7.87\"\"H. )This high bar dining set has a simple structure. With detailed instructions and numbered parts, This bar table and chair can be assembled in time it can be assembled in the time it takes to make a cup of mojito.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wPog-4LCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Recaceik","source_asin":"B09ZQMJB8J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZQMJB8J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZQMJB8J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1008898,"name":"OXO Good Grips SimplyTear Paper Towel Holder - Stainless Steel & Good Grips Non- Slip Spoon Rest","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mNeRE7fhL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"OXO Good Grips SimplyTear Paper Towel Holder - Stainless SteelThe SimplyTear Paper Towel Holder has a Spring activated arm to hold the roll securely and allows for a one handed tear. No matter what brand or size paper towel roll you use, the arm automatically adjusts to the width of the roll. The stainless steel arm keeps the paper towel edge accessible at all times so you do not have to search for the edge. The SimplyTear Paper Towel Holder is designed with internal resistance to prevent the paper towel roll from unraveling. Loading the Paper Towel Holder is easy. The arm pivots away from the center pole and locks open, allowing you to slip the paper towel roll over the center pole without a fuss. A weighted stainless steel base and non-slip ring keep the Paper Towel Holder in place. Made of brushed stainless steel with black plastic accents, OXO’s SimplyTear Paper Towel Holder is an elegant addition to any kitchen countertop.OXO Good Grips Non- Slip Spoon RestOXO is dedicated to providing innovative consumer products that make everyday living easier. We study people—lefties and righties, male and female, young and old—interacting with products and we identify opportunities for meaningful improvement. Our thoughtful, “question everything” process and relentless attention to detail uncover the best solutions for life’s everyday tasks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mNeRE7fhL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B09R4RN51N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R4RN51N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R4RN51N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
