window.products.push({"id":1008962,"name":"Gravity Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set, Automatic Pepper Mill Grinder Upgraded Larger Capacity, Adjustable Coarseness & Led Light, One Hand Oper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71moANc8fgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥗𝗚𝗥𝗔𝗩𝗜𝗧𝗬 𝗦𝗘𝗡𝗦𝗜𝗡𝗚 & 𝗣𝗥𝗢𝗧𝗘𝗖𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡 𝗦𝗬𝗦𝗧𝗘𝗥𝗠 - Upgraded Salt and pepper grinder set features gravity-sensing design, which means you can free your hands. You just need to turn the knob to adjust the coarseness, Then turn on the \"ON\" switch, and turn the pepper grinder upside down to get fresh seasoning. (Please push the safety switch to \"OFF\" after use). The system will be shut down automatically if the grinder is accidentally dropped. 💡𝗔𝗗𝗝𝗨𝗦𝗧𝗔𝗕𝗟𝗘 𝗖𝗢𝗔𝗥𝗦𝗘𝗡𝗘𝗦𝗦 & 𝗟𝗘𝗗 𝗟𝗜𝗚𝗛𝗧 - With the ZABOUL electric salt and pepper grinder set, you can grind salt and pepper to your preferred coarseness. When the salt grinder is working, the LED will light up automatically, and the grinding process is clearly visible, so you don't have to worry about seasoning your food with too much. A small brush is included in the package to easily clean your kitchen gadgets. 🥩𝗕𝗘𝗔𝗨𝗧𝗜𝗙𝗨𝗟 𝗔𝗡𝗗 𝗣𝗥𝗔𝗖𝗧𝗜𝗖𝗔𝗟 - The stainless steel body is more beautiful and durable than ordinary glass containers, and the transparent container cover can see the storage area and the remaining amount clearly. upgrade to larger capacity design can allow more seasoning to be added at one time, no multiple additions, No sore wrists, it is a good helper for your kitchen! 🔋𝗨𝗦𝗕 𝗗𝗨𝗔𝗟 𝗖𝗛𝗔𝗥𝗚𝗜𝗡𝗚 𝗕𝗔𝗦𝗘 - The automatic salt and pepper grinder set has a built-in 3.7V 500mAh lithium battery, which can be easily charged with a Type-C cable. you can takes 2.5 hours to fully charge to support 200 uses. No need to replace the battery, it is a little helper to save money in life! The pepper mill grinder suitable for white pepper, black pepper, sea salt, cumin, rosemary, fennel, parsley falkes, mung beans, soybeans, Sichuan peppercorns and other solid grain seasonings. 🌹𝗔𝗕𝗢𝗨𝗧 𝗨𝗦 - ZABOUL is a self-owned brand, who is committed to providing you with the finest kitchen and dining accessories. We hope to recommend ZABOUL to everyone who loves kitchen, enjoys the cooking and life! Good communication is the best way to solve problems, please feel free to contact us if you have any questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71moANc8fgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZABOUL","source_asin":"B0BVTTXZ9B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVTTXZ9B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVTTXZ9B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1008963,"name":"National Tree Company Pre-Lit Artificial Mini Christmas Tree, Green, Crestwood Spruce, White Lights, Decorated with Pine Cones, Berry Clusters, Froste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":113.36,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mgg34l5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Transform your home into a winter wonderland with National Tree Company's Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Tree. This majestic Crestwood Spruce tree is 4 feet tall and 26 inches in diameter at the bottom, making the tree perfect for entryways and tight spaces. Friends and family alike will marvel at how the tree closely mimics those outside. Made to look and feel lifelike, the stunning realism of the tree is defined by its close attention to detail, featuring hundreds of individually crafted branch tips that make up the wide, full-bodied branches that create space for your lights and ornaments. The tree is designed with a hinged branch system that allows the branches to swing down for a quick and simple set-up and fold back in for easy storage. Set aside 45-60 minutes after assembly to properly shape the tree by peeling back the branches and pulling the tips apart to give the branches a more full-bodied look. This fantastically festive tree is strung with 100 white UL lights prior to packaging and includes a sturdy, metal base for a more convenient setup. The lights operate individually, so if the bulb lens has not been cracked or broken, the light set will continue to illuminate except for any individual bulbs that are not working. Before dressing the tree in twinkling lights and glistening ornaments, consider placing it in a living room or dining area where it can be viewed from multiple angles and does not block any entryways. Constructed with sturdy, high quality materials and hypo-allergenic, fire-resistant needles, this tree is built to bring holiday cheer for years to come. At National Tree Company, we strive to create high quality Christmas decorations to help you transform your home so you can keep making every holiday moment magical.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mgg34l5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"National Tree Company","source_asin":"B08N69MPT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N69MPT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N69MPT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
