window.products.push({"id":1008972,"name":"VOLLEY BALL LOLLY","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MtUP8ZSLL._AC_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MtUP8ZSLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B00FOLOQO6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00FOLOQO6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00FOLOQO6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1008973,"name":"Diatomaceous Earth Bath Mat, Fast-Drying Nonslip Absorbent Bath Mat for Bathroom Shower Floor, 15.74 x 11.81 inch, Grey, 2 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BmwF6JV3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"What is Diatomite Earth Mat Natural diatomite earth bathroom mat is full of tiny pores and passages good absorptive ability. It is quite sturdy and will not break easily. This is a new type of bath mat. It appears like a compact and hard stone plate. This mat is hard not soft. You will be like stepping on a cool slate. It will be a fantastic experience to feel water being sucked right off your feet. The advantages compared with traditional bath mat 1.Super absorbency, Amazing touch feeling, and quick drying. 2.Daily washing is no longer required. Try a new type of bath mat from now   Notice 1. The floor mat is made of diatom mud, it is hard rather than soft. Since this diatomite bath mat is hard, please avoid hitting the mat when you step on it. 2.If you feel micronized powders on the surface, it is not a quality issue but a normal phenomenon of the productive process. You can use damp cloth and lightly rub away. 3.Please put the mat in a well-ventilated place to air dry and do not expose it directly under sunlight for a long time. 4.Do not use detergents containing surfactants and dip into water. 5.Do not step on this bath mat with your shoes, otherwise the stains will be sucked. 6.Do not use on the uneven ground or soft ground and also not on the sharp object.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BmwF6JV3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Muzha","source_asin":"B08WYRCVGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08WYRCVGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08WYRCVGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1008974,"name":"Now Designs Basic Cotton Kitchen Chef's Apron, Pinch and Dash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GdIZVDvuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This unisex basic kitchen bib style apron is a beloved classic by Now Designs and is truly a workhorse in the kitchen. It is made from heavy-weight 100 percent cotton and woven on an oversized loom making it 6 inches wider than other aprons to help provide the perfect fit. This chef's apron is designed to fit men and women: it ties at the waist and features an adjustable neck strap for a comfortable fit. Stress points throughout the apron have been bar-tacked for extra durability and to resist wear and tear. The deep front pocket is great for tucking away recipe cards, kitchen towels or dishcloths, trivets and utensils. This attention to detail ensures that a Now Designs Basic Cotton Apron is sure to be a consistent kitchen companion for years to come. Care is simple: machine wash and dry. This classic apron was designed and made by Now Designs. For 50 years, Now Designs has created kitchen textiles, table linens and accessories that are consistently recognized for superior colors, trends, design and unsurpassed quality and workmanship. Coordinating oven mitts and potholders sold separately, available on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GdIZVDvuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B00931OUHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1008974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00931OUHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00931OUHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
